WEBVTT

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:10.760
"Discipline Committee"

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.630
"Discipline Committee"

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.630
All I'm saying is,

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.840
I need some space just for today!

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.720
What was that?

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.260
Sounds like a commotion.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.260
What's the proble--

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.520
Hirano.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.850
What're you doing? Go home already.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.980
He and his girlfriend seem
to be fighting again.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.310
Oh, <i>fudanshi</i>!

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.570
Just who I need!

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:30.030
Huh?

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:30.480
"Voice Call"
"Emi Yokoda"

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:30.480
Huh?

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.940
"Voice Call"
"Emi Yokoda"

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.940
Be my <i>fujoshi </i>interpreter!

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.070
"Voice Call"
"Emi Yokoda"

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.070
Excuse me?!

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.160
H-Hello?

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.160
Tell me. Do you like delinquent <i>ukes</i>?

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.000
He normally acts high and mighty,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.750
and when others are around,
he has a bad attitude toward the <i>seme</i>,

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.420
yet the moment the two are alone, he is
pushed down by the aggressive <i>seme</i>,

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.970
suddenly at the mercy of
the unexpectedly strong <i>seme</i>,

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.800
and though his words indicate
reluctance, his body can't resist,

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.930
and the next day he's startled at the
<i>seme</i>'s cool, unconcerned attitude,

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:03.640
and the <i>seme </i>gets him back for everything,
but he becomes more and more bound to him,

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:08.020
and a reforming romance blooms.
That's the essence of delinquent <i>uke</i>.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.820
Do you like it?

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:11.730
I confess, yes.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:12.690
Mya-<i>chan</i>?

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.150
Hey! Don't confess feelings for my girl!

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:19.280
I-I didn't! She was telling me
about delinquent <i>ukes </i>just now.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:20.950
Let me listen, too.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.870
Hirano, aren't they a little too close?

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:29.500
I-I don't know. Don't ask me.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.540
Sasaki's doing this on purpose...

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:34.800
I mean, yeah, I like delinquent <i>ukes</i>,

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.800
--but I only started liking
them after dating Jiro.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:37.760
--Jiro?
--but I only started liking
them after dating Jiro.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.470
--Ogasawara's first name.
--He's like, "You went after a delinquent
because you like delinquent <i>ukes</i>."

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:40.050
--Oh.
--He's like, "You went after a delinquent
because you like delinquent <i>ukes</i>."

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.390
--Oh.
--Like, that's crazy!

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:44.100
I didn't fall for him
because he's a delinquent.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.270
She just keeps going...

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:51.400
--Hey, put in on speaker so I can hear.
--...and he's a worry-wart...

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.980
Jiro's a big idiot!

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:54.230
What'd you say?!

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:58.240
Come on. You suddenly said you
needed space. What's that about?

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:02.620
I-I mean, you had that manga
hidden in your photo albums.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.870
What?! What'd you read it for?!

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:07.460
I go to the trouble
of hiding it to spare you!

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.370
Hiding it makes me more curious!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:11.420
--Holy hell. It was a wolf
and a delinquent!

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:12.090
--Should this still be on speaker?
--Holy hell. It was a wolf
and a delinquent!

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:13.630
--Should this still be on speaker?
--I'm hooked on stories of
pure love that transcends words!

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:15.800
--They're always fighting like this.
--I'm hooked on stories of
pure love that transcends words!

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.880
--How do you fall in love
if you can't communicate?

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.510
--They can fight...
--How do you fall in love
if you can't communicate?

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:20.300
--...because they're so close. They fight
at least once every two weeks.
--Little things make you realize
you're being shown care,

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.890
--...because they're so close. They fight
at least once every two weeks.
--and your perspective changes.

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.560
--After rain comes...
--The little ways you're shown care
change how you see the world.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:25.430
--We're not at the fair weather yet.
--The little ways you're shown care
change how you see the world.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:26.980
--We're not at the fair weather yet.
--Gradually bonds deepen.
There are lots of stories like that!

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.440
Words are unnecessary!

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.310
Clothes coming off
from tentacles is a classic!

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:36.070
C-Calm down! Is it okay to loudly
shout something like that?

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.940
Well, <i>fudanshi</i>, is it?

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:39.400
I'd have to rule that out of bounds.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:43.700
See, it's out of bounds!
Stop talking for a sec!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.330
You make me so mad.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.290
You have the worst timing,

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:49.830
and we just go in circles on the phone.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:50.830
Enough of this.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.040
I'm coming to you, so stay put!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.880
Right now?!

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.710
She hung up.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:58.010
She's coming here?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:01.590
Yeah. She's at the nearby co-ed school.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:04.970
Oh, then she'll be here in ten minutes.

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:05.970
What is it?

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:06.970
Oh, nothing.

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.350
Crap, I better get moving.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:12.230
No running. She's gonna wear
the pants in your marriage, huh?

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:15.190
Huh? You're gonna marry her?

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:19.030
I don't move on a woman
I have no intention of marrying.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.530
I think that's the kind of thing
she likes about you.

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.200
That I'll let her wear the pants?!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.620
Emi!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.710
I'm sorry.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.300
Life goals...

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.590
I'm this way, so see ya.

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.430
Goodbye, Hirano-<i>senpai</i>.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.100
Bye-bye.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.180
Mya-<i>chan</i>, let's drop by the bookstore.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:49.180
Okay.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:56.690
Hey, do ya think when we're
walking together like this,

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:58.860
we look like we're dating?

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:07.240
D-Don't we just look like
a normal <i>senpai </i>and <i>kouhai</i>?

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.880
Are you self-conscious?

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:27.100
Well,

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.930
I'm figuring things out,

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:30.640
so of course.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:39.020
"What it means to be dating"

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:59.500
"Sasaki and Miyano"

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:14.540
"Episode 8: 'I Realized.'"

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.290
Miyano.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.540
A cross-dressing competition outfit.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.130
"Bam."

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.250
"Bam."
I brought a variety of options.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.550
Wow.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.220
Wow...

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.720
What is your class doing for the festival?

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.050
An escape room.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:32.550
It's like a puzzle.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.470
Oh, that sounds fun!

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.270
Maybe I'll come check it out.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.100
By all means.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.640
Miyano.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:41.230
Excuse me, Chairman. I'll be right back.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.230
Sure.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.660
You're cross-dressing, too,
as a backup, right?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.580
Yes.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:07:01.880
Hey, you guys.
I brought more card... board?

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.170
Tashiro, don't let go!

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.630
Uh, excuse me! What's your name?

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.930
My name is Tasuko Kuresawa.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.850
Ah! Idiot! It's Kuresawa!

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.640
Seriously, Tashiro? For real?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.400
Kuresawa, I got more blackout curtai--

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.270
What happened?

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.400
Nothing!

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:27.480
I cross-dressed and Tashiro
mistook me for a girl.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.150
--But our love story failed to take off.

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.570
--Shut up, dummy! Never speak of it!
--But our love story failed to take off.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:38.040
I don't want to turn my friends into BL,
so please stop providing material.

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:41.670
I'm not! Kuresawa is the problem!

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:45.210
Sorry. Miyano, can we do your
fitting tomorrow after school?

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:47.880
Oh, of course. Thank you.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.460
Okay. Tomorrow it is.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:56.550
Ta. Shi. Ro.

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:58.600
Everyone's forgotten about it.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.060
--Leave me alone, Kuresawa!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.100
--Come on out.
--Leave me alone, Kuresawa!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.190
Ah! Ruffian!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.020
You were able to wear your outfit?

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:11.070
Yeah. Hanzawa-<i>senpai</i>'s sister
is about as tall as him.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.950
What? So she's over 5'7''?

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:19.120
In a year, I could be that tall, too...

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.620
Why're you on tiptoe?

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:26.500
I also wanna be at least 5'9''.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.840
Won't you get there?
You're already 5'7'', right?

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:31.800
Not sure. Wanna measure?

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.050
"Secret aspiration"

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.600
I accidentally stayed up
all night reading.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.230
But that ending thing:

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:53.990
"His fingertips were cold because
he was nervous the whole time."

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.610
That wasn't fair. How could I
not reread from the beginning?

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:19.010
Why did I just think about Sasaki-<i>senpai</i>?

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.640
I need to get to class!

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.560
--Mya-<i>chan</i>, your bangs look cute--

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.940
--Sorry, but please forget you saw this!
--Mya-<i>chan</i>, your bangs look cute--

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:28.560
"He saw me."

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:30.190
I'll go on ahead.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.150
Okay.

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.150
You have dark bags under your eyes.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.690
Did something happen?

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:39.030
Um... it sorta went on too long...

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.780
What did?

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:45.410
I was reading a novel
on my phone yesterday.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:50.790
I only meant to reread a little,
but before I knew it, it was morning.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.380
Oh, so you stayed up all night.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.760
I didn't mean to. Suddenly it was morning.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.550
Is that why you put your bangs up?

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:00.970
Yeah, I was getting annoyed with them.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:03.930
Oh. You look cute with your
forehead showing like that.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.680
Oh, gee. Great...

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.730
Can I kiss your forehead?

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.350
What did you--

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.020
What're you saying?!

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:16.110
Just kidding. Somebody might pass by.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:19.360
That really woke me up.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:23.330
But then, if nobody were around...

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:27.250
Could you put your bangs down?
This time it's not a joke.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.210
Huh?

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:33.170
Things just sorta feel... off with
your hair different from normal.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:37.550
Well, I suppose so...

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.930
I hope the barrette didn't make bumps.

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:53.940
His hands are cold.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.070
Better. Thanks.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:10:59.990
Oh, there's the bell.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.490
Sorry for keeping you. See ya later.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.280
Right. Bye.

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:23.140
That kinda...

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:35.150
...reminds me...

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:44.990
In that moment, and in that moment, too...

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:46.580
...his fingertips were...

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.080
...cold--

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.840
Uh-oh! The final bell!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:03.510
Miyano-<i>kun</i>! I'm heeere!

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:06.890
Chairman. Thank you.

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.770
Will your class be okay?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:11.560
Yup. Hirano said it's fine.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:16.150
I just have to go back to helping
them once I'm done with you.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:19.030
Come on, come on! Get changed! Here.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.610
Ch-Chairman?!

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.910
How... do I look?

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.700
Good. Good.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:29.290
This counts?

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:32.000
Yes. The skirt is for girls.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.040
We'll do makeup next time.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.420
A kimono-style outfit works nicely.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.880
Oh, lift your arms.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.260
Oh, okay.

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:45.300
I knew Kuresawa's would be, but your
shoulders are pretty broad, too.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:48.760
I should adjust the length and add boots.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.430
I'll toss the idea of
chest padding... Maybe frills?

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.940
You're putting some thought into this.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:59.320
Oh, I better show my sister.
Pose for a picture.

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.480
What?

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:05.610
You can use this to hide
your face if you prefer.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:06.780
Okay.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:11.700
It seems odd for me to say this
when you're helping me like this,

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.580
but you're really gung-ho about this.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:15.830
True.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:19.090
It's my last high school
cultural festival,

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:22.710
and I want to fully enjoy school events.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:25.510
Graduation is only
six months away, after all.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:30.310
So you did fall for someone?

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.390
What?!

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:42.400
Chairman, what do you think
it means to like someone?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.610
Tough question...

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:47.610
I think it varies from person to person...

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.870
Oh, face the window.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.460
For instance, wanting
to do things for them.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.290
Wanting to be around them.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.260
Wanting to hold their hand.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:09.390
Wanting to touch them.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.430
Wanting to kiss them.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.310
Wanting to hold them.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.600
Wanting them all to yourself.

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:22.770
All to myself...

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:25.280
Lastly, another formulation of it is...

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:25.820
"I loved the manga you gave me! Thanks!"

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:25.820
"I knew you'd like it. I'm glad."

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.320
"I loved the manga you gave me! Thanks!"

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.320
"I knew you'd like it. I'm glad."
Oh, there he is. Hanzawa-<i>senpai</i>!

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.700
"I loved the manga you gave me! Thanks!"

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.700
"I knew you'd like it. I'm glad."
Be right there.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:31.660
Sorry, Miyano. Hold on a moment.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:32.910
Of course.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:46.970
Wanting to... do things for him...

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.340
Like for his birthday?

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:55.270
But that was as a thank you,
and as a <i>kouhai</i>...

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.850
I've never thought about it.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:01.980
What I want to do for Sasaki-<i>senpai</i>...

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:06.940
Whoa, whoa. How come I'm assuming
I want to do something for him?

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:13.990
Do I... want to see him
as a target of romantic interest?

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.040
I'm so confused!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:23.540
Your hair is just in such a wild state.

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:26.710
It gets wild easily...

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:30.840
Sorry. Sorry. You don't want to cut it?
To hide your face, was it?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:34.760
That doesn't really
bother me much anymore...

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.770
And I don't get teased for it as much.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.680
Besides, Sa--

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:48.780
S-Somehow, I realized I don't
need to be so stuck on that.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:56.080
Oh, to finish what I was saying earlier.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.830
Yes?

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.580
They say love is

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:05.250
being unable to keep
someone out of your mind.

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:10.800
I... thought about
Sasaki-<i>senpai </i>all day today...

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:13.090
What?!

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:15.220
Okay! Let's go see what your class thinks!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.220
Huh? W-Wait. Not just yet.

